xpected to fail GRPO recovery (RewardDesertCallback triggers). This is the negative control — confirms RASP's structure selection enables recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 0 / 负向 4 / 失败 3 / 共 9\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2097, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HU7s7m3dBSsuEu26xfH7mz","session_id":"abb965cf-b673-4ef3-ad15-a808ac75ed71","uuid":"aa646ec0-17e8-4abb-adcf-05fd5d179985","timestamp":"2026-05-15T00:24:48.803Z"}
