{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HEh9dabzGxFSMSmw4zVwxp","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 recovery_aware_struct_prune 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (12 个)\\n\\n- **sft_standard_20**: RUNNING — \\n- **sft_rasp_20**: RUNNING — \\n- **grpo_rasp_20_4096**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **grpo_standard_20_4096**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **grpo_standard_20_fast**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **grpo_rasp_20_fast**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4**: PREPARING — \\n- **grpo_standard_20**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **grpo_rasp_20**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_rasp_pipeline_v3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp_rasp_pipeline**: DONE (failed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-14\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| sft_standard_20 | D013 Stage 1: SFT warmup on Standard-pruned model (20%, 1% GSM8K) as negative control. Expected: SFT partially recovers format but reasoning remains limited. | — | — | — |\\n| sft_rasp_20 | D013 Stage 1: SFT warmup on RASP-pruned model (20%, 29% GSM8K) to restore EOS generation ability before GRPO Stage 2. | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4: CKA functional overlap F(h) predicts structured pruning recoverability under RLVR. RASP scoring S(h)=I(h)×(1-F(h))^α selects structures whose removal is more recoverable via GRPO RLVR than standard importance-only pruning. V4: Dual sparsity probe (20% + 25%) to find viable operating point where pruned models retain >5% accuracy, then GRPO recovery comparison.（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **grpo_rasp_20_4096** (failed): D010: RASP-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 29% GSM8K) GRPO recovery with max_completion_length=4096 (fix D009 truncation). Core MVP experiment — if recovery succeeds, RASP structure selection enables RLVR recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\n- **grpo_standard_20_4096** (negative): D010: Standard-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) GRPO recovery with max_completion_length=4096 (fix D009 truncation). Negative control — expected to fail recovery due to non-optimal structure selection, confirming RASP advantage. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\n- **grpo_standard_20_fast** (negative): Standard-pruned model (20% sparsity, post-prune 1% GSM8K) expected to fail GRPO recovery (RewardDesertCallback triggers). This is the negative control — confirms RASP's structure selection enables recovery that standard pruning cannot. ← 基于 mvp_rasp_pipeline_v4\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 0 / 负向 4 / 失败 3 / 共 9\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestb-23072: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp_rasp_pipeline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- grpo_rasp_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- grpo_standard_20: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- grpo_rasp_20_4096: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016WXBWcLY7RjjvSXo8NcBAK","session_id":"abb965cf-b673-4ef3-ad15-a808ac75ed71","uuid":"150b8527-7582-4ac7-8aa8-bce602fa9266","timestamp":"2026-05-15T00:25:09.935Z"}
